  "contentHtml": "<p>226행사에서 전지현 선생님(서울 월천중)께서 소개해주신 활동을 기초로해서 1시간짜리 시각실험을 진행해보았습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5515508bf1aa7d1d938910298319cec90f719737\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5515508bf1aa7d1d938910298319cec90f719737\" data-origin-width=\"1514\" data-origin-height=\"423\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/455ad19f1e69a01cd045c46b1f06366b72d5170e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/455ad19f1e69a01cd045c46b1f06366b72d5170e\" data-origin-width=\"1497\" data-origin-height=\"410\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e212f647878391bdc8e8400753a423a13e3dcba9\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e212f647878391bdc8e8400753a423a13e3dcba9\" data-origin-width=\"1502\" data-origin-height=\"411\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/39954ae41ba022016b9ddedef12e998c53a39ae7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/39954ae41ba022016b9ddedef12e998c53a39ae7\" data-origin-width=\"1505\" data-origin-height=\"412\"><div class=\"figcaption\">&#65532;</div></div><p>실험준비물 : 아래사진처럼 담고(<u>사진찍은 후 딱풀 뚜껑에 빨간테이프 두름. 상이 뒤집힌 걸 더 잘 인식하도록</u>) + 바닥에 A4용지 붙여두기</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8369a92e8b3889c0e8469e8cdabe27580224bf9e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8369a92e8b3889c0e8469e8cdabe27580224bf9e\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1081\"></div><p>실험안내+실험(패들렛 업로드)+활동지 해결하니 한 차시 분량이 되었습니다.&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>과학실 최대한 어둡게 만들고 활동시간은 10분.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>미션1. 동공변화는 대부분 잘 해서 올렸어요. 6모둠중 4-5모둠 잘 올림</p><p>미션2. 딱풀사진은 반당 1-2모둠이 선명한 글씨 보이게 찍었고, 나머지 모둠은 저기 딱풀이 있네가 느껴지는 사진을 찍었습니다.</p><p>미션3은 그냥 해보기였고, 다음 시간에 부족한 설명과 시각인식경로까지 다룰 예정입니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&lt;학생 사진&gt;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ec19b523a55e717c5818cb55acb70d9875388ff4\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ec19b523a55e717c5818cb55acb70d9875388ff4\" data-origin-width=\"240\" data-origin-height=\"164\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/60ccfc7719b032ffb7ccee881187f88923fbdedb\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/60ccfc7719b032ffb7ccee881187f88923fbdedb\" data-origin-width=\"244\" data-origin-height=\"134\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/68adaaabee409e4f9812543bc78b1147c375e7a8\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/68adaaabee409e4f9812543bc78b1147c375e7a8\" data-origin-width=\"643\" data-origin-height=\"344\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e15650c350ed3a387de1f6c7fbd3d5d62fba63c5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e15650c350ed3a387de1f6c7fbd3d5d62fba63c5\" data-origin-width=\"483\" data-origin-height=\"345\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6eec2631108222c9395fc761286f0c22ab3b4a1a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6eec2631108222c9395fc761286f0c22ab3b4a1a\" data-origin-width=\"397\" data-origin-height=\"561\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6953de4ef451e5df55cbe8efda88057405c54762\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6953de4ef451e5df55cbe8efda88057405c54762\" data-origin-width=\"1094\" data-origin-height=\"694\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
